与插座</p><p class=\"desc\">带个充电器逐个试插座，顺便看电表和空开。</p></div></li>\n<li><span class=\"no\">05</span><div class=\"body\"><p class=\"item\">下水与异味</p><p class=\"desc\">厨卫同时放水，看下水快不快、有没有返味。</p></div></li>\n<li><span class=\"no\">06</span><div class=\"body\"><p class=\"item\">家电与家具</p><p class=\"desc\">空调、热水器、冰箱逐一开机，有问题拍照写进合同。</p></div></li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"foot\"><p class=\"tip\">收藏起来，看房时对着查。</p><p class=\"mark\">租房笔记 · 06</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\nEOF\nmeasure-cjk lint index.html; echo exit=$?","description":"Write card HTML and run Chinese typesetting lint"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_016CLvNDULFFKx8mk9RZEZMz","tool_input":{"command":"cp measure-skill/assets/measure.css measure.css && measure-cjk lint index.html; echo exit=$?","description":"Copy base CSS and lint the card"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":8,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"我生成了两个文件：`index.html` 是 1080×1440 的竖版清单卡，`measure.css` 是从 measure-skill 复制过来的中文排版基础样式，页面会引用它。\n\n- **卡片内容**：标题是“租房前一定要检查的 6 个地方”，下面列了 6 项：水压与热水、门窗与门锁、墙角与天花板、电路与插座、下水与异味、家电与家具，每项配一句怎么检查。配色是米纸底、墨色字，强调色用青瓷绿和朱砂红两种。\n- **校验**：`measure-cjk lint` 通过，0 个 error，0 个 warn。这是基础档检查，没有在浏览器里实际渲染测量，结果是近似判断。\n- **字体**：用的是霞鹜文楷（LXGW WenKai），授权是 OFL-1.1，可以出商用图片（[原文](https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai/blob/main/OFL.txt)，授权表核验日期 2026-10-25）。这个字体没有随文件附带，电脑上没装的话，浏览器会换成别的衬线字体显示。\n- **还没导出 PNG**：要出图，把霞鹜文楷的字体文件放进一个文件夹，再运行 `measure-cjk card index.html --out card.png --font-dir <字体目录>`。","ttft_ms":5433,"type":"result","duration_ms":95907,"uuid":"5079317d-5cd7-4fa8-9af5-e6c3575792d6","ttft_stream_ms":4893,"time_t